OL,3,ASir Sean Connery's family plans new
OL,4,Afilmmaking centre in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of Sir Sean Connery has
OL,7,Fannounced plans for a new filmmaking
OL,8,Fcentre in Edinburgh.
OL,10,FIt will be named after the James Bond
OL,11,Factor, who worked as a milkman in the
OL,12,FScottish capital before becoming a
OL,13,FHollywood star.
OL,15,FHis children say they want it to
OL,16,Fprovide training for the next
OL,17,Fgeneration of Scotland's film and TV
OL,18,Ftalent and help them build lasting
OL,19,Fcareers.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
