OL,3,ASir Sean Connery's family plans new
OL,4,Afilmmaking centre in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said their father "understood that
OL,7,Fwhile talent may be distributed
OL,8,Fequally, opportunity is not, and that
OL,9,Fthose who demonstrate determination and
OL,10,Fendeavour should have the chance to
OL,11,Ffulfill their potential".
